cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Who Holds Government Debt?"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yiran Emma
    family-names: Ma
    affiliation: Johns Hopkins University
repository-code: "https://github.com/emma0502/emma0502606"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for the paper "Who Holds Government Debt?". The paper
  develops a model in which the composition of public debt across domestic
  banks, domestic non-banks, and foreign investors is determined by endogenous
  borrowing limits, and structurally estimates the model on panel data of
  debt composition.
keywords:
  - sovereign debt
  - debt composition
  - financial repression
  - borrowing limits
  - REMARK
  - Reproduction
license: Apache-2.0
